  "full_text": "thinks I care that I don't have an audience. I don't give any fucks. Basically, I talk to God. I don't know what kind of denial they're in. They think it's not God. I talk to God. He's my boss. Said I'm king. He's all powerful. Just waiting for him to do shit, right? He's gonna give me orders. Comes straight from God, you know? So fuck it. I'm just chilling, right? Becoming a better king. Just like in the past month, like I've... I've learned, like, what he wants out of the kingship, right? He said, God said, you're king. You got to promise me you're going to kill the vile people, right? So there you go. So, like, I'm in training to be a king, right? Working out what are my goals and shit like that. Yeah, so, like, the Trumps and stuff, I don't know what they're fucking retarded. They're, like, in denial that it's God. They don't think it's God. They're, like, you don't got an audience. I'm sitting there. Yeah, I'm talking to God, like. And when he feels like it, he can do whatever the fuck he wants, you know? You don't quite appreciate that. God's my boss. Fucking ain't giving me no orders, right? So, like, we're just talking. He's still talking. Like, we're learning. We're having fun. Sure as hell ain't no fucking slave. I'm increasing my skills and becoming prepared to be king, you know? Maybe it takes three years. God's going to train me, make me an excellent king, right? This shit doesn't happen overnight. God's got to coordinate his angels. God works real fucking slow, you know. So it's like fucking hilarious, man. I don't know. They're like in denial. They're like, he's talking to someone. I don't know. What do they think he's talking to? My boss is God. He's omnipotent. He says I'm king. Just fucking waiting for him to give me orders and shit. So there you go.",
